<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Projects Programme — Savills Cloud Portal</title>
  <%- include("partials/head-css") %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= baseUrl('/css/programme.css') %>" />
</head>
<body>
<div id="screen-app" class="programme-page">
  <%- include("partials/topbar") %>
  <%- include("partials/admin-hub", { active: "programme" }) %>
  <main class="programme wrap<%= canEdit ? '' : ' is-readonly' %>">
    <div class="head">
      <div>
        <h1>Projects Programme</h1>
        <p class="intro">Surveyor × week-commencing matrix. Tick <strong>Active</strong> then hit <strong>Refresh</strong> to show or hide people on the board (Agency F·E goes to the agency pool; others go to the team pool). The stamps along the top are Current and Upcoming projects. Drag a stamp onto a week, or drag a grid tile across cells to copy it. Click a tile and press Delete or Backspace to clear it. Surveyor names stay fixed. The three tables underneath are live Project Progress projects.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="head-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="btnExcel">Export Excel</button>
        <% if (canEdit) { %>
        <button type="button" class="btn" id="btnRefresh" title="Apply Active ticks: move people on or off the main grid">Refresh</button>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="toolbar">
      <span class="hint" id="dndHint"><% if (canEdit) { %>Tick Active (left of the name), then Refresh to update the board. Drag a Current or Upcoming stamp onto a week (Shift+drop paints a run). Drag a grid tile across cells to copy it. Click a tile, then Delete or Backspace to clear it.<% } else { %>View only. Every admin can open this board and export Excel. Only Tom Sharp can move tiles, edit cells, or save changes.<% } %></span>
      <span class="meta"><span id="meta"></span> <span id="saveState"></span></span>
    </div>

    <div class="palette" id="palette" aria-label="Project stamp palette"></div>
    <p class="order-note" id="orderNote"></p>

    <div class="board-layout">
      <div class="board-main">
        <div class="board-shell">
          <div class="scroll" id="scroll">
            <table class="matrix" id="matrix" aria-label="Programme matrix">
              <thead></thead>
              <tbody></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="admin-slot-note">
          <% if (usingPersonnelAdmins) { %>
          Admin rows are taken from Personnel → Admins.
          <% } else { %>
          Yellow separator and placeholder admin rows until Personnel has admins.
          <% } %>
          Holiday / Festive Period cells use <span class="leave-sample">red text</span> on a muted fill. Drag a stamp onto the grid, or drag a grid tile to copy it. Click a tile and press Delete or Backspace to clear that cell. Surveyor names stay put.
        </p>
        <p class="note-f">Active sits left of the name. F / E marks agency. Untick Active and Refresh to move someone into the pools below; tick and Refresh to bring them back. Empty weeks stay blank.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="pools" aria-label="Bench pools">
      <div class="pool-card" id="poolAgency">
        <h3>Agency — not on a project<span class="pool-sub">F·E agency marker off the board — tick Active and Refresh to restore</span></h3>
        <ul class="pool-list" id="agencyPool"></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pool-card" id="poolTeam">
        <h3>Team — not currently live<span class="pool-sub">Non-agency off the board — tick Active and Refresh to restore</span></h3>
        <ul class="pool-list" id="teamPool"></ul>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="dnd-toast" id="dndToast" role="status"></div>

    <section class="projects-block" aria-label="Projects numbers and comments">
      <div class="pb-head">
        <h2>Projects — Numbers / Comments</h2>
        <p class="pb-cap" id="projCap"></p>
      </div>
      <div class="proj-cols">
        <div class="proj-col" id="colCurrent">
          <h3>Current<span class="proj-sub">Live jobs</span></h3>
          <table class="proj" id="projCurrent">
            <thead><tr><th style="width:22%">Project</th><th style="width:10%">Stock</th><th style="width:24%">Survey types</th><th style="width:16%">Project manager</th><th style="width:14%" title="Distinct week columns on the main programme grid where this project is assigned. Several people in the same week count once.">Nr of Weeks</th><th style="width:14%" title="Nr of Weeks × 40. The same distinct week columns on the main grid, as an approximate survey count.">Approx surveys</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-col" id="colUpcoming">
          <h3>Upcoming<span class="proj-sub">Awaiting start / confirmation</span></h3>
          <table class="proj" id="projUpcoming">
            <thead><tr><th style="width:22%">Project</th><th style="width:10%">Stock</th><th style="width:24%">Survey types</th><th style="width:16%">Project manager</th><th style="width:14%" title="Distinct week columns on the main programme grid where this project is assigned. Several people in the same week count once.">Nr of Weeks</th><th style="width:14%" title="Nr of Weeks × 40. The same distinct week columns on the main grid, as an approximate survey count.">Approx surveys</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-col" id="colCompleted">
          <h3>Completed<span class="proj-sub">Last 5 archived</span></h3>
          <table class="proj" id="projCompleted">
            <thead><tr><th style="width:34%">Project</th><th style="width:14%">Stock</th><th style="width:34%">Survey types</th><th style="width:18%">Project manager</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="footer"><% if (canEdit) { %>Board changes are saved from your account.<% } else { %>This board is view only for your account. Tom Sharp can change it.<% } %> Current, Upcoming, and Completed read Project Progress. Stock is the number of assets on that project. Survey-type text starts from the project's survey-type ticks. Nr of Weeks counts each occupied week once; Approx surveys is that count × 40.</p>
  </main>
</div>
<script id="programme-data" type="application/json"><%- programmeJson %></script>
<script src="<%= baseUrl('/js/programme.js') %>"></script>
<%- include("partials/pending-alerts") %>
</body>
</html>
